WEBVTT

00:07.360 --> 00:09.140
Nice serve, Yuki.

00:09.140 --> 00:10.160
You did so well.

00:10.160 --> 00:11.560
Thank you very much.

00:11.800 --> 00:12.700
Ah…

00:12.700 --> 00:14.960
Yuki is so beautiful
no matter what she does.

00:14.960 --> 00:17.200
She doesn't feel like our age at all.

00:17.580 --> 00:19.660
Yuki scored again with her serve.

00:19.660 --> 00:21.320
So cool!

00:21.320 --> 00:24.960
Her real talent is much more than that.

00:25.200 --> 00:28.000
She's beautiful and smart,
and good at sports.

00:28.220 --> 00:30.760
It's hard to believe
you're related to her, Hitoyoshi.

00:31.780 --> 00:34.100
Yeah, that's what I think too.

00:35.380 --> 00:37.280
Miss Yuki was an assassination target.

00:37.280 --> 00:39.440
It led me through a movie-like experience.

00:39.440 --> 00:42.040
That excitement has not
completely faded away even now.

00:42.900 --> 00:45.220
A ruthless murderer.

00:45.440 --> 00:48.800
She is the fourth of
the 'Dragon's Nine Offsprings,'

00:49.060 --> 00:50.740
the White Wolf Xue.

00:51.500 --> 00:53.660
I will not kill anyone anymore.

00:54.400 --> 00:57.820
Nor will I let anyone die because of me.

00:58.260 --> 01:00.950
DRAGON'S NINE OFFSPRINGS ASSASSIN
There are so many things that make me curious.

01:01.420 --> 01:06.000
However, she is still
striving to be 'normal.'

01:08.300 --> 01:08.780
Ah.

01:08.780 --> 01:09.960
What?

01:11.760 --> 01:14.100
GAZE
She is working hard in her own way.

01:14.100 --> 01:17.380
GAZE
These jealousy and envy

01:18.060 --> 01:19.140
have no effect on me.

01:21.280 --> 01:22.680
Hey, Hitoyoshi.

01:25.200 --> 01:27.440
Oh my, that's really dangerous.

01:28.540 --> 01:31.780
If you get hurt,

01:32.200 --> 01:33.480
someone will be upset.

01:33.800 --> 01:36.100
The unease I'm feeling now

01:36.100 --> 01:38.490
is not just because of Miss Yuki.

01:39.240 --> 01:42.990
SMILEY
Her presence also plays a big part.

01:45.960 --> 01:52.340
(You Are Ms. Servant.)

03:14.000 --> 03:16.840
(Episode 6: You Are Quite Lonely)
Why do you want me, Ms. Nitta?

03:17.120 --> 03:18.520
Why like this?

03:18.520 --> 03:22.140
Can't you be nicer to a new teacher
who doesn't know the place?

03:22.140 --> 03:23.900
Hitoyoshi?

03:23.900 --> 03:25.200
You are too close to me.

03:25.200 --> 03:28.060
I want you to maintain the social distance
between teacher and student.

03:28.060 --> 03:30.080
JEALOUSY

03:30.080 --> 03:34.140
As for why things
have turned out this way.

03:38.420 --> 03:39.560
MEOW
I'm here.

03:39.560 --> 03:40.360
MEOW
Who are you?

03:40.520 --> 03:41.620
Oh, stop it.

03:41.620 --> 03:44.020
Didn't we spend a passionate night
together just yesterday?

03:44.020 --> 03:45.460
Have you already forgotten?

03:45.460 --> 03:47.300
I'm Grace.

03:47.300 --> 03:50.840
My role here is
the new PE teacher, Ms. Nitta.

03:50.840 --> 03:54.660
Your cousin who just arrived in Tokyo.

03:55.520 --> 03:57.920
Your appearance and tone
are way too different.

03:57.920 --> 04:00.040
Also, this persona is too complicated.

04:00.040 --> 04:02.240
While Xue specializes in knives,

04:02.240 --> 04:03.800
what I am good at is intelligence.

04:04.440 --> 04:07.640
I'm a master especially in disguise.

04:07.920 --> 04:09.940
However, this is my true appearance.

04:10.220 --> 04:11.360
Or,

04:11.360 --> 04:13.940
do you prefer black long hair?

04:13.940 --> 04:15.280
Just like Miss Yuki.

04:15.280 --> 04:16.180
Eh?

04:16.180 --> 04:17.940
No, that's not the case.

04:19.840 --> 04:22.040
Your thoughts are
written all over your face.

04:22.040 --> 04:23.760
You are really interesting.

04:23.760 --> 04:25.620
I think you have learnt your lesson.

04:25.620 --> 04:27.640
Why do you come to me now?

04:28.880 --> 04:32.420
I like interesting things the most.

04:32.420 --> 04:35.860
That legendary assassin, Lady Xue,

04:35.860 --> 04:38.760
would actually serve
a brat in a place like this

04:38.760 --> 04:41.080
and even declared no longer killing.

04:41.480 --> 04:45.920
I definitely couldn't experience something
this interesting on the southern islands.

04:45.920 --> 04:46.980
So,

04:46.980 --> 04:50.540
I no longer wish to kill you,
nor do I wish to be killed by you.

04:50.780 --> 04:52.460
Which means I have
no hostility whatsoever.

04:52.900 --> 04:56.240
Of course, I don't expect you
to believe my words.

04:56.240 --> 04:57.420
Let's negotiate.

04:57.980 --> 05:00.160
Negotiations among assassins.

05:00.440 --> 05:05.140
First of all, I will not attempt to
harm either of you anymore.

05:06.940 --> 05:08.140
And also…

05:08.620 --> 05:12.920
Does she want to offer money
or information for the bargain?

05:14.600 --> 05:17.860
I will provide three months' worth
of school store bread.

05:17.860 --> 05:18.880
Eh? Bread?

05:18.880 --> 05:20.240
What an unremarkable offer.

05:20.600 --> 05:24.100
No, this could be a code among assassins.

05:24.100 --> 05:26.640
Of course, what I am offering
is not ordinary bread.

05:26.640 --> 05:28.220
What I will provide you with

05:30.060 --> 05:31.360
is Katsuta Bread.

05:31.360 --> 05:32.080
Yes.

05:32.080 --> 05:34.350
Unlimited supply of Katsuta Bread,
how does that sound?

05:38.640 --> 05:39.380
Deal.

05:39.380 --> 05:40.380
Ah, she accepted.

05:40.380 --> 05:42.920
Negotiation succeeded.

05:43.540 --> 05:44.740
Miss Yuki,

05:45.040 --> 05:47.020
is it really okay?

05:47.020 --> 05:49.000
Please don't worry.

05:49.460 --> 05:53.420
In this society, it's forbidden
to kill civilians at will.

05:53.880 --> 05:56.340
Now she has understood
that she's no match for me.

05:56.560 --> 05:59.800
Causing you harm would
bring her no benefits.

06:00.860 --> 06:03.900
Even if she intends to,

06:04.280 --> 06:06.360
I will surely protect

06:06.360 --> 06:07.380
your savety.

06:07.920 --> 06:09.360
Wipe your drool first.

06:09.660 --> 06:11.660
She's a small fry.

06:11.660 --> 06:14.140
Even if there are thousands of her level,

06:14.140 --> 06:15.700
they pose no threat to me.

06:15.700 --> 06:16.780
Is that so?

06:16.780 --> 06:19.740
Oh, she sees me as a minor character.

06:20.560 --> 06:22.080
Anyway, that's it.

06:22.080 --> 06:24.840
I'll continue to secretly observe you.

06:24.840 --> 06:25.900
I'm looking forward to it.

06:27.380 --> 06:29.680
That's what she said.

06:29.920 --> 06:33.660
Actually, I don't like PE class at all.

06:33.660 --> 06:37.600
But the positions where I can slack off the most
are either this or a health teacher.

06:37.920 --> 06:40.720
Didn't you say you would
observe in secret?

06:41.220 --> 06:43.180
Aren't I secretly talking to you now?

06:43.180 --> 06:45.640
Can you please not talk into my ear?

06:46.240 --> 06:47.900
Also, I'm thinking

06:47.900 --> 06:51.260
whether she actually minds
what we're doing.

06:51.600 --> 06:54.140
Yuki, serve the ball.

06:54.140 --> 06:54.980
Okay.

06:54.980 --> 06:56.620
I'm very sorry.

06:58.020 --> 07:01.340
She's probably worried that
you might do something weird.

07:02.500 --> 07:04.140
Didn't you notice?

07:04.140 --> 07:05.440
Notice what?

07:05.440 --> 07:08.280
No, nothing.

07:10.820 --> 07:11.820
But,

07:11.820 --> 07:14.300
it's still better for me

07:14.760 --> 07:16.320
to give you

07:17.360 --> 07:19.140
a special lesson.

07:30.800 --> 07:31.970
TOO MUCH FORCE
Ah.

07:32.220 --> 07:33.760
Yuki, you're amazing.

07:33.760 --> 07:36.480
You broke through the net, that's cool.

07:36.480 --> 07:37.820
Yuki, who exactly are you?

07:37.820 --> 07:39.800
-Well… I…
-Do you want to join our club?

07:40.440 --> 07:41.460
Eh…

07:58.000 --> 08:00.540
That was so embarrassing.

08:03.720 --> 08:07.160
One thing is certain,
it was not your fault.

08:09.240 --> 08:10.260
But,

08:10.660 --> 08:12.040
why did it happen?

08:18.300 --> 08:20.560
I'm not quite sure myself.

08:21.600 --> 08:24.940
I'm well aware that Grace means no harm.

08:25.599 --> 08:26.659
But,

08:26.660 --> 08:30.140
when I see you with others
from the underworld,

08:30.140 --> 08:33.660
I somehow feel a sense of alienation.

08:35.400 --> 08:37.840
Is this normal?

08:38.220 --> 08:42.120
Or is something wrong with me?

08:44.920 --> 08:49.360
Didn't you notice?

08:50.090 --> 08:50.840
MISS YUKI FEELS JEALOUS FOR THE FIRST TIME

08:52.560 --> 08:55.060
Eh, that is normal.

08:55.860 --> 08:57.360
Normal?

09:00.340 --> 09:01.600
Master Hitoyoshi?

09:45.900 --> 09:47.620
Good morning.

09:48.340 --> 09:50.100
Master Hitoyoshi!

09:50.100 --> 09:52.760
The towel… the towel has become so soft!

09:52.760 --> 09:53.760
Oh.

09:54.160 --> 09:57.920
She struggled for a month after starting
the challenge of washing towels.

09:58.460 --> 10:01.360
Sometimes she would wash
dark clothes with towels.

10:01.360 --> 10:04.680
Sometimes she would pour
dishwashing liquid into the washing machine.

10:04.680 --> 10:07.120
Or she washed them without
checking for tissue in the pockets.

10:07.120 --> 10:09.200
After a series of failures,

10:09.480 --> 10:12.220
she finally succeeded
in washing the towels.

10:12.220 --> 10:14.300
A great progress, Miss Yuki.

10:14.900 --> 10:15.820
Yes.

10:16.220 --> 10:18.430
Agemochitarou, are you also happy for her?

10:20.040 --> 10:21.340
So warm.

10:21.580 --> 10:23.100
I'll go fold it.

10:35.760 --> 10:36.960
Alright.

10:37.480 --> 10:39.680
What should we have for dinner?

10:40.060 --> 10:41.440
Dinner.

10:41.720 --> 10:44.500
I think there's only
cabbage in the fridge.

10:45.280 --> 10:46.440
Cabbage.

10:46.440 --> 10:47.700
Shred.

10:47.700 --> 10:49.460
Shredded cabbage.

10:51.800 --> 10:54.280
Isn't that shredded cabbage
next to the fried pork cutlet?

10:54.280 --> 10:55.880
No, isn't it the special seat for Katsuta sauce?

10:55.880 --> 10:58.380
KATSUTA SAUCE
No, isn't it the special seat for Katsuta sauce?

11:00.580 --> 11:03.120
Auntie Fuku, I'd like two orders
of fried pork cutlet.

11:03.120 --> 11:04.880
Alright.

11:05.120 --> 11:07.280
KATSUTA DELI
Thank you for always patronizing us.

11:07.280 --> 11:11.690
KATSUTA DELI
It will be ready soon, please wait a moment.

11:11.820 --> 11:13.280
Sorry about the wait.

11:13.280 --> 11:14.160
Okay.

11:14.160 --> 11:15.420
Well,

11:16.480 --> 11:19.140
who is this beautiful lady?

11:19.140 --> 11:20.340
Master Hitoyoshi.

11:20.340 --> 11:22.660
Inside the box,

11:22.660 --> 11:25.040
there is so much Katsuta sauce.

11:25.040 --> 11:26.500
Uh…

11:26.700 --> 11:29.600
She is the maid working at our house.

11:29.940 --> 11:33.500
Katsuta sauce was created here, wasn't it?

11:33.500 --> 11:35.100
I'm so touched.

11:35.680 --> 11:37.180
I feel a sense of closeness.

11:38.900 --> 11:42.440
Have you felt this way before?

11:42.440 --> 11:46.010
Yes, when I used to
go to the hero theater.

11:46.010 --> 11:47.560
HERO THEATER AT GARDEN PARK

11:48.900 --> 11:53.320
Seeing your favorite things
right before your eyes is exciting.

11:54.120 --> 11:55.740
This is quite normal.

11:56.220 --> 11:57.640
Normal.

11:59.980 --> 12:02.560
Sorry to keep you waiting.

12:02.560 --> 12:04.160
The pork cutlet is ready.

12:04.160 --> 12:06.080
Do you want it sliced?

12:06.080 --> 12:08.140
Yes. Thank you.

12:08.880 --> 12:10.520
Please look, Master Hitoyoshi.

12:11.960 --> 12:15.980
Hands trembling with age
is a big taboo when using knives.

12:16.220 --> 12:17.260
However,

12:17.760 --> 12:20.060
in the moment of cutting the pork,

12:24.160 --> 12:27.480
his hands stopped trembling
and he sliced extremely precisely.

12:29.240 --> 12:32.120
To cut so evenly at such an old age,

12:32.720 --> 12:34.260
what kind of training has he undergone?

12:34.880 --> 12:36.160
Could he be in the business too?

12:36.160 --> 12:40.640
Could he be… the legendary
assassin active in Japan?

12:41.320 --> 12:43.300
Such a strong fan filter.

12:43.540 --> 12:45.220
What's the matter?

12:45.220 --> 12:46.740
Ah, it's nothing.

12:46.740 --> 12:49.760
This maid lady is a loyal fan
of your Katsuta sauce.

12:49.760 --> 12:50.740
Right?

12:53.680 --> 12:55.400
I see.

12:55.400 --> 12:56.900
That's really heartwarming.

12:56.900 --> 12:59.920
I made that sauce, you know.

13:01.200 --> 13:03.640
So you are the god?

13:04.560 --> 13:08.660
It's nothing, Grandpa thought
of the recipe, and I made it.

13:08.660 --> 13:10.220
I'm sorry.

13:10.220 --> 13:12.640
Katsuta sauce is really popular.

13:12.900 --> 13:15.660
The fried food is also
crispy and delicious.

13:15.660 --> 13:17.200
I see.

13:17.200 --> 13:19.000
Thank you.

13:19.000 --> 13:23.000
I… I really want to thank you properly.

13:23.320 --> 13:25.060
Thank me?

13:26.740 --> 13:30.500
I've never found dining to be delicious,

13:30.500 --> 13:33.960
let alone enjoyable.

13:34.400 --> 13:37.940
But when I first tasted this sauce,

13:37.940 --> 13:39.820
it completely changed my world.

13:41.040 --> 13:43.380
You might think I'm exaggerating,

13:43.380 --> 13:47.960
but this is very important to me.

13:48.340 --> 13:50.180
Whenever I taste this sauce,

13:50.180 --> 13:52.280
I get an indescribable feeling

13:52.280 --> 13:54.480
which warms my whole heart.

13:56.040 --> 13:58.120
So please allow me to sincerely

13:58.440 --> 14:00.220
thank you.

14:00.220 --> 14:02.600
Lady Katsuta Fuku.

14:05.720 --> 14:07.840
You are a maid, right?

14:08.120 --> 14:08.960
Yes.

14:08.960 --> 14:11.680
Miss Maid, are you happy now?

14:11.680 --> 14:13.080
Happy…

14:13.360 --> 14:18.080
You feel warmth because you are happy.

14:18.080 --> 14:23.860
Maybe it's because you feel happy
that you can appreciate the sauce.

14:25.280 --> 14:27.020
It's just my guess.

14:27.020 --> 14:28.460
Sorry.

14:29.860 --> 14:31.280
Warmth.

14:32.620 --> 14:35.000
No… maybe…

14:35.640 --> 14:37.480
Maybe it really is so.

14:44.540 --> 14:46.520
Oh, miss,

14:47.040 --> 14:50.560
you have dust on your shoulder.

14:50.980 --> 14:53.760
He managed to appear
behind me unexpectedly.

14:55.000 --> 14:57.560
Grandpa Katsuta

14:57.860 --> 14:59.620
is indeed not an ordinary person.

15:01.500 --> 15:04.620
I have some freshly made sauce here.

15:04.620 --> 15:06.340
Do you want to have a taste?

15:06.340 --> 15:07.780
Eh?

15:07.780 --> 15:09.520
Yes, please let me have a taste.

15:09.520 --> 15:11.540
Just a little taste.

15:21.420 --> 15:22.500
Master Hitoyoshi.

15:22.500 --> 15:24.060
This sauce is so delicious.

15:24.060 --> 15:25.680
Sauce.

15:26.680 --> 15:27.620
That's great.

15:34.500 --> 15:36.300
I'm full.

15:37.080 --> 15:39.140
Please let me do the dishes.

15:39.480 --> 15:41.940
Please go rest.

15:41.940 --> 15:43.540
Mmm, thank you.

15:48.620 --> 15:50.640
How should I put it?

15:55.340 --> 15:58.580
Seeing Miss Yuki
so happy over small things,

15:58.820 --> 16:02.280
it's really hard to believe
she was once the strongest assassin.

16:03.690 --> 16:04.560
DRAGON'S NINE OFFSPRINGS ASSASSIN

16:06.260 --> 16:09.700
The internet only says
that it is a Chinese legend.

16:12.220 --> 16:15.120
Should I go ask her?

16:15.560 --> 16:16.720
But,

16:16.720 --> 16:19.900
maybe she'll find it hard to disclose.

16:19.900 --> 16:21.020
Moreover,

16:21.400 --> 16:24.060
though she has decided to
let go of her painful past,

16:24.560 --> 16:26.800
that's not something that
can be easily forgotten.

16:27.540 --> 16:30.900
I don't want to stir up her past trauma.

16:30.900 --> 16:34.960
The right way is probably to
wait for her to tell me herself.

16:36.020 --> 16:37.080
Probably.

16:39.060 --> 16:42.660
Even so, I still want to
learn more about her.

16:46.400 --> 16:49.240
Hitoyoshi.

16:49.780 --> 16:52.340
If you want to see me, you always can.

16:52.620 --> 16:53.660
I'm sorry.

16:54.000 --> 16:56.620
It's all my fault that
it became like this.

16:57.360 --> 16:59.220
I have to go, Hitoyoshi.

16:59.880 --> 17:01.320
Mom.

17:01.540 --> 17:02.900
Don't go!

17:02.900 --> 17:05.720
We will meet again soon, Hitoyoshi.

17:05.720 --> 17:08.940
Don't leave me, mom!

17:08.940 --> 17:11.160
Mom!

17:13.500 --> 17:14.740
Master Hitoyoshi.

17:20.100 --> 17:21.360
Are you okay?

17:22.240 --> 17:23.820
You were talking in your sleep.

17:23.820 --> 17:25.380
When I came to check on you,

17:25.380 --> 17:28.020
you suddenly fell towards me,

17:28.020 --> 17:30.000
so I caught you instinctively.

17:32.220 --> 17:33.680
Ah!

17:33.680 --> 17:34.900
So… sorry.

17:35.600 --> 17:38.260
I have had a strange dream.

17:38.780 --> 17:41.060
Is it that dream about your mother again?

17:41.320 --> 17:42.980
Uh, yeah.

17:43.780 --> 17:45.040
In that case,

17:45.740 --> 17:47.440
would you like to lie down on my thigh?

17:47.440 --> 17:48.780
You really like that.

17:49.280 --> 17:50.000
No need.

17:50.000 --> 17:52.180
I've already woken up, don't worry.

17:54.740 --> 17:55.860
This is…

17:55.860 --> 17:56.640
Eh?

17:56.640 --> 17:57.680
Ah.

17:58.240 --> 18:00.120
You're looking into this.

18:00.420 --> 18:01.440
Mm.

18:01.440 --> 18:02.740
Are you curious?

18:02.740 --> 18:04.200
A bit, yes.

18:04.580 --> 18:08.160
Because I know nothing about you,
I can't help but…

18:09.260 --> 18:10.580
I see.

18:10.960 --> 18:12.620
Actually,

18:14.020 --> 18:17.000
I'm not very clear about what kind of
organization 'Dragon's Nine Offsprings' is.

18:17.660 --> 18:21.980
I was picked up by master and
brought into that organization,

18:21.980 --> 18:26.480
but I simply carried out tasks
according to master's instructions.

18:28.000 --> 18:31.400
I've only met a few members there.

18:31.760 --> 18:33.360
But I don't even know their names.

18:33.360 --> 18:35.720
So there's not much I can tell you.

18:36.080 --> 18:37.800
So it's not that she won't tell me,

18:37.800 --> 18:39.340
she truly doesn't know.

18:39.340 --> 18:41.160
Back then,

18:41.160 --> 18:43.840
I was more focused on
doing all I could to survive.

18:44.220 --> 18:46.680
I had no interest in others.

18:47.220 --> 18:52.780
I never even tried to understand
what I was doing or why I was doing it.

18:53.360 --> 18:55.060
I was only worried about
disappointing my master

18:55.060 --> 18:59.160
and losing the place to stay.

19:02.900 --> 19:06.900
So, I'm still not used to everything here.

19:07.620 --> 19:09.240
The chirping of birds outside.

19:09.240 --> 19:11.780
The sunlight through the curtains.

19:12.020 --> 19:16.680
These insignificant things
are all so dazzling in my eyes.

19:17.100 --> 19:18.920
KATSUTA SAUCE
They make me feel incredibly amazed

19:19.840 --> 19:24.920
and wonder if I'm still in a dream.

19:26.100 --> 19:28.320
Because to me, they're all too dazzling.

19:29.660 --> 19:33.000
But just by seeing you,

19:37.980 --> 19:44.420
I'm suddenly reminded that
I am learning to be an ordinary girl.

19:46.160 --> 19:47.680
When the day

19:47.680 --> 19:50.420
I get used to this way of life comes,

19:51.260 --> 19:53.980
I guess by then I'll be an ordinary girl.

19:54.520 --> 19:56.840
The thought of it makes me very happy.

19:57.280 --> 19:59.520
Me… me too.

19:59.880 --> 20:03.180
Every morning when I see you,
I feel reassured.

20:03.860 --> 20:05.300
Or should I say, happy.

20:06.000 --> 20:09.900
Because even after that incident,
you still chose to stay here.

20:10.260 --> 20:13.660
That's why I want to know more about you.

20:14.380 --> 20:15.880
So…

20:16.220 --> 20:17.160
Anyway,

20:17.640 --> 20:19.820
I'm truly grateful that
you came to my house.

20:21.560 --> 20:23.540
Really… thank you.

20:26.180 --> 20:27.260
Yes.

20:30.040 --> 20:32.840
Then, let me tell you more about myself.

20:34.240 --> 20:37.300
The reason I like having you lie on my lap

20:37.620 --> 20:44.260
is because that night was the first time
I genuinely felt I was able to help you.

20:45.100 --> 20:46.220
So,

20:46.220 --> 20:48.480
the next time you have a nightmare,

20:48.480 --> 20:50.260
I will be ready to assist you at any time.

20:51.360 --> 20:53.340
Uh…

20:53.880 --> 20:54.900
Well.

20:55.980 --> 20:57.900
Hmm, thank you.

20:58.520 --> 21:01.040
Then, I'll also share
something about myself.

21:01.720 --> 21:05.560
Actually, the dream I just had
was not really a nightmare.

21:06.800 --> 21:08.780
What kind of dream was it?

21:09.940 --> 21:11.760
It was probably a dream

21:17.940 --> 21:23.440
where a heroine took
my mother's place to welcome me.
